  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WeLight feasibility studies for metro grid Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad supports WeLight with market studies, technical studies, impact assessment and a review of local regulation and policy in preperation of increasing the capacity of three metro-grids - the combination of existing solar mini-grids and diesel generators -  in Madagascar. The main project mostly consists of increasing the capactiy factor of the existing solar assets with battery storage and improved grid connections, as well as adding solar energy capacity where necessary.</narrative>
  </description>
